<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- First 10 Customers Playbook -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How to Get Your First 10 Customers</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">1. Make a List of 50 Target Customers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Write down names, companies, or profiles. Be specific. Where do they hang out?</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 italic">Example: "Sarah (marketing director at Series A SaaS) - active on LinkedIn"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">2. Personal Network First</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Your first 3-5 customers should come from people who know you. Announce what you're building.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Text 20 people: "Hey! I just launched [product]. Would love your feedback if you're interested."</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">3. Join Communities Where Your ICP Lives</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Reddit, Discord, Slack groups, Facebook groups, LinkedIn groups</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Don't spam. Add value for 2 weeks, then share what you built when relevant.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">4. Cold Outreach (B2B)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">LinkedIn messages or email. Keep it short, personal, valuable.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 italic">Template: "Hi [Name], saw you work on [problem]. Built [solution]. Can I show you a 5-min demo?"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">5. Offer Free/Discounted Access for Feedback</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">"Founding customer" pricing in exchange for weekly calls and detailed feedback</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">This isn't about revenue yet - it's about learning and retention signals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">6. Personally Onboard Every User</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Schedule 30-min onboarding calls. Walk them through setup. Ask tons of questions.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">You're building a relationship, not just getting a signup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">7. Track Everything in a Spreadsheet</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Customer name, source, signup date, activity level, feedback notes, churn reason</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">This data becomes gold when you're ready to scale.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">8. Ask for Referrals</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">After a good experience: "Who else do you know who struggles with [problem]?"</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Warm intros convert 5-10x better than cold outreach.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Acquisition Channels Grid -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-blue-600 rounded-xl p-6 text-white">
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">🎯 B2C Tactics</h4>
      <ul class="text-sm text-blue-100 space-y-2">
        <li>• Post in relevant subreddits</li>
        <li>• Share on Twitter with hashtags</li>
        <li>• Product Hunt "Ship" page</li>
        <li>• Facebook/Discord communities</li>
        <li>• Friends & family referrals</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-600 rounded-xl p-6 text-white">
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">🏢 B2B Tactics</h4>
      <ul class="text-sm text-purple-100 space-y-2">
        <li>• LinkedIn connections → DMs</li>
        <li>• Cold email campaigns (50/day)</li>
        <li>• Industry Slack/Discord groups</li>
        <li>• Ask customers for intros</li>
        <li>• Comment on relevant posts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Success Metrics -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-green-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Success Metrics</h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">10</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Customers in first 4 weeks</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">5-15%</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Response rate (cold outreach)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">30min</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Per customer (onboarding time)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
